  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Yakimeshi is a master class in "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "wok frying ",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "wok-frying"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". Also known as "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "chahan ",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "chahan"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", it cooks in under 10 minutes when the wok is hot enough and the rice is cold. The egg goes in early and coats every grain before the seasonings are added. Serves 4."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Short-grain rice clumps more than long-grain, so refrigerating it overnight is essential. Press the cold rice apart with your hands before it goes into the wok."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What you need"
          }
        ]
      },
